## Análisis de producto terminado de una fabricación diaria de camembert

En formato `CSV` y `Excel`

[Descargar `camembert.csv`](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/juanriera/master-queseria/master/datos/camembert.csv)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(gt)
library(dplyr)

df <- read.csv2("datos/camembert.csv", dec = ",")

df |> 
  slice_head(n = 6) |> 
  gt() |>
  fmt_number(
    columns = where(is.numeric),
    decimals = 2
  ) |>
  tab_style(
    style = cell_fill(color = "#f7f7f7"),
    locations = cells_body(rows = seq(1, 6, 2))
  ) |>
  tab_options(
    table.font.size = px(14),
    data_row.padding = px(6)
  )
```

